  "scope": "XIRI_IP30_M3B3 routes IOC3 SuperIO on Bridge input 4 to HEART vector 16, enables UART A receive interrupts, and verifies masked deferral, handler delivery, source drain, polled fallback and absence of an interrupt storm. It preserves the polled console and checks external console input/output at the root-device prompt. Bridge DMA, storage and generic PCI interrupts are not implemented.",
